    <string name="feature_settings_impl_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="feature_settings_impl_privacy_body">Resonote stores theme, playback and lyrics preferences, queue and playback/search history, and music you explicitly import on this device. Sign-in credentials use encrypted storage. Online content, sign-in, cloud music and recognition communicate with upstream services only when required by those features. Opening About checks the public GitHub Releases endpoint for updates. Recognition audio is used for the current request and cleared after completion, cancellation or failure. Desktop lyrics use the system display-over-other-apps permission and an on-device foreground service only while enabled; Resonote does not read other apps’ notifications. Resonote contains no advertising, analytics or telemetry. Playback cache only reduces repeated traffic and can be cleared at any time.</string>
